  "goodToKnow": "Der Überrest, mostly plural Überreste, means remains or remnants: Überreste einer Burg, die sterblichen Überreste (mortal remains). Archaeologists often find Roman Überreste in Germany, especially along the Limes, the old Roman frontier, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, and in cities like Trier and Cologne. Food leftovers are simply die Reste: Reste essen. Plural: die Überreste."
